	"system": {
		"description": "<p>After taking the attack action on your turn, you may strike the fear of eternity into the undead. As a bonus action, you brandish a holy sign, whether a symbol, tattoo, or gesture of divinity. Undead within 15ft must immediately make a Charisma save or become [[/condition id=frightened]] for up to 1 minute. At the end of each of their turns, they may make an additional Charisma save to attempt to end the frightened condition.</p>",
